---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---

<BaseLayout
  title="SEO Intelligence Dashboard — Demo with Simulated Data"
  description="A React-based SEO analytics dashboard built with Astro, TypeScript, and a simulated GSC/GA4/Clarity dataset. Portfolio demo project."
>
  <section style="display: grid; gap: 32px;">
    <div>
      <p class="eyebrow">Phase 4 · Portfolio demo</p>
      <h1 style="margin-top: 8px;">SEO Intelligence Dashboard</h1>
      <p class="muted" style="margin-top: 12px; max-width: 60ch; font-size: 1.05rem;">
        A React analytics surface built on top of an Astro shell, backed by a deterministic
        simulated dataset shaped after Google Search Console, Google Analytics 4, and Microsoft
        Clarity responses. The data boundary, processing layer, REST API, and dashboard UI are all
        real and reviewable; the underlying data is <strong>synthetic</strong>.
      </p>
    </div>

    <aside
      class="surface"
      style="padding: 16px 20px; border-left: 3px solid var(--color-warning);"
      role="note"
    >
      <p style="font-weight: 600;">Demo project using simulated SEO data.</p>
      <p class="muted" style="margin-top: 4px; font-size: 0.9rem;">
        No real Search Console, GA4, or Clarity account is connected. Adapters in
        <code>src/data/</code> produce deterministic numbers from a seeded RNG so every build shows the
        same metrics.
      </p>
    </aside>

    <div
      style="display: grid; gap: 20px; grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(240px, 1fr));"
    >
      <article class="surface" style="padding: 20px;">
        <p class="eyebrow">Architecture</p>
        <h3 style="margin-top: 8px;">Data → API → UI</h3>
        <p class="muted" style="margin-top: 8px; font-size: 0.9rem;">
          Static simulated dataset, pure-function processing, Astro REST endpoints, React island
          dashboard. Boundaries match PRD section 9.5.
        </p>
      </article>
      <article class="surface" style="padding: 20px;">
        <p class="eyebrow">Stack</p>
        <h3 style="margin-top: 8px;">Astro + React + TS</h3>
        <p class="muted" style="margin-top: 8px; font-size: 0.9rem;">
          Strict TypeScript, ESLint with zero warnings, Prettier, and Vitest. Quality gates mirror
          the rest of the portfolio.
        </p>
      </article>
      <article class="surface" style="padding: 20px;">
        <p class="eyebrow">Honesty</p>
        <h3 style="margin-top: 8px;">Explicit data labels</h3>
        <p class="muted" style="margin-top: 8px; font-size: 0.9rem;">
          Every surface that shows numbers is tagged with its simulated source (GSC, GA4, Clarity)
          per the project honesty policy.
        </p>
      </article>
    </div>

    <div>
      <a
        href="/dashboard/"
        class="surface"
        style="display: inline-block; padding: 12px 18px; text-decoration: none; font-weight: 600;"
        >Open the dashboard →</a
      >
    </div>
  </section>
</BaseLayout>
